### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Upload Recording
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/recordings
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./test-audio.mp3
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Get Task Status
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}

### Get Recordings List
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/recordings?page=1&page_size=10

### Get Recording Detail
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/recordings/{{recording_id}}

### Retry Failed Task
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/tasks/{{task_id}}/retry

### Delete Recording
DELETE http://localhost:8080/v1/recordings/{{recording_id}}
